<% content_for :title, "Refunds & returns | #{current_store.name}" %>
<%= render layout: "pages/legal", locals: { eyebrow: "Legal", title: "Refunds & returns" } do %>
  <h2>The 30-day guarantee</h2>
  <p>If the product is not for you, tell us within <b>30 days of delivery</b> and we will refund what
     you paid for the goods. You do not need a reason. This is the guarantee advertised across this
     store, and it applies even to an opened jar — we would rather you tried it.</p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>Email <%= mail_to current_store.support_email %> with your order number, which is in your
     confirmation email. We answer within one business day and tell you whether to return the jar or
     keep it. Do not send anything back before we reply: an unannounced return can arrive without a
     reference and cannot be matched to your order.</p>

  <h2>Return shipping</h2>
  <p><mark class="legal__todo">State who pays return postage — you or the customer — and give the return
     address.</mark> Where a return is our fault (wrong item, damaged, faulty) we always pay.</p>

  <h2>When you get your money</h2>
  <p>We refund to the original payment method within <b>5 business days</b> of approving the request, or
     of receiving the return where one was asked for. Your bank then takes its own time, usually two to
     five days. Shipping you originally paid is refunded when the whole order is returned; it is not
     refunded on a partial return.</p>

  <h2>Damaged or wrong on arrival</h2>
  <p>Send us a photograph within 48 hours of delivery and we replace it or refund it in full, including
     shipping. Keep the packaging until we have answered.</p>

  <h2>Cancelling before dispatch</h2>
  <p>Write to us before your order ships and we cancel it and refund you in full. Once it has shipped,
     the guarantee above takes over.</p>

  <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
  <p>A subscription can be cancelled at any time from the link in any order email, or by writing to us.
     Cancelling stops future deliveries; a delivery already dispatched is covered by the 30-day
     guarantee like any other order.</p>

  <h2>Your statutory rights</h2>
  <p>This guarantee is offered on top of the rights the law already gives you as a consumer, and does
     not replace them.</p>
<% end %>
